================================================================================
THIRD-PARTY MATERIAL
================================================================================

The sub-course "Design in the Literature" quotes short passages from the methods
sections of published open-access papers, with attribution and a link to each
source, for the purpose of commentary and teaching. Those passages remain the
work of their authors under their own licences. The full texts themselves are not
redistributed here; scripts/09_fetch_fulltexts.py retrieves them from Europe PMC
into literature/papers/, which is excluded from version control.

Reference metadata is retrieved from Crossref and Europe PMC and is subject to
their terms of use.
